M.Sc. Medical Radiation Technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc. Medical Physics, where eligible"},{"text":"M.Sc. Biomedical Technology"},{"text":"M.Sc. Healthcare Technology"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc. Clinical Research"},{"text":"M.Sc. Biomedical Science"},{"text":"Medical Imaging Research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MBA Healthcare Management"},{"text":"MBA Hospital Administration"},{"text":"Master of Public Health"},{"text":"Eligibility varies by institution and underlying bachelor's degree."}]}]},{"heading":"Career Specializations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"🧠 Neuro-Imaging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Brain CT"},{"text":"Brain MRI"},{"text":"Stroke imaging"},{"text":"Neuro-oncology imaging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"🫁 Thoracic Imaging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Chest CT"},{"text":"Lung imaging"},{"text":"Pulmonary imaging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"🦴 Musculoskeletal Imaging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MRI joints"},{"text":"Spine MRI"},{"text":"Sports injuries"},{"text":"Orthopedic imaging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"❤️ Cardiac Imaging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cardiac CT"},{"text":"Cardiac MRI"},{"text":"CT angiography"}]},{"type":"h","text":"🎗️ Oncology Imaging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cancer staging"},{"text":"Treatment monitoring"},{"text":"Whole-body imaging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"🚑 Emergency Imaging"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Trauma CT"},{"text":"Acute neurological imaging"},{"text":"Emergency radiography"}]},{"type":"h","text":"🤖 Imaging Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted imaging"},{"text":"3D reconstruction"},{"text":"Image post-processing"},{"text":"Advanced visualization"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc. Medical Imaging Technology","Clinical Internship","Junior Radiographer","Radiographer","CT / MRI Technologist","Senior CT/MRI Technologist","Modality Specialist","Imaging Supervisor","Clinical Application Specialist / Educator"]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["Radiographer","Advanced Imaging","PACS / Image Processing","Imaging Informatics","Medical Imaging AI","Clinical Imaging Technology Specialist"]}]},{"heading":"Emerging Technologies","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Medical imaging is rapidly becoming more computational."},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted imaging"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI image reconstruction"},{"text":"Automated image quality assessment"},{"text":"AI-based lesion detection"},{"text":"Workflow prioritization"},{"text":"Automated segmentation"},{"text":"Radiomics"},{"text":"Clinical decision-support systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Low-dose CT"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop awareness of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Dose optimization"},{"text":"Iterative reconstruction"},{"text":"AI-based reconstruction"},{"text":"Protocol optimization"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced MRI"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Faster MRI acquisition"},{"text":"AI reconstruction"},{"text":"Motion correction"},{"text":"Quantitative MRI"},{"text":"Advanced diffusion imaging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Imaging informatics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DICOM"},{"text":"PACS"},{"text":"RIS"},{"text":"Cloud imaging"},{"text":"Image archiving"},{"text":"Data interoperability"}]}]},{"heading":"Recommended Final Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By graduation, aim for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Human Anatomy"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Radiographic Principles"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"General Radiography"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"CT Technology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"MRI Technology"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Patient Positioning"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Image Quality"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Radiation Safety"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"MRI Safety"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Contrast Safety"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"PACS / RIS"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"DICOM"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Quality Assurance"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"Emergency Imaging"},{"text":"+"},{"text":"AI in Medical Imaging"}]}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate should demonstrate:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong anatomical knowledge"},{"text":"General radiography competency"},{"text":"CT fundamentals"},{"text":"MRI fundamentals"},{"text":"CT/MRI clinical exposure"},{"text":"Excellent patient-positioning skills"},{"text":"Strong radiation-safety awareness"},{"text":"Excellent MRI-safety knowledge"},{"text":"Contrast-safety awareness"},{"text":"Image-quality assessment"},{"text":"PACS/RIS familiarity"},{"text":"DICOM fundamentals"},{"text":"Emergency-imaging experience"},{"text":"Quality-assurance knowledge"},{"text":"Professional patient communication"},{"text":"Awareness of AI-assisted imaging"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended portfolio"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Medical Imaging Technology Portfolio containing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"General radiography clinical record"},{"text":"CT internship record"},{"text":"MRI internship record"},{"text":"MRI safety competency record"},{"text":"CT image-quality project"},{"text":"MRI artifact analysis project"},{"text":"Radiation-safety project"},{"text":"PACS/DICOM project"},{"text":"Emergency-imaging case study"},{"text":"AI medical-imaging project"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"“Medical imaging professional with strong CT/MRI technical expertise, patient-positioning skills, radiation and MRI safety knowledge, image-quality assessment, PACS/DICOM proficiency, and emerging AI-enabled imaging capabilities.”"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest career positioning is general radiography foundation + CT + MRI + safety + image quality + imaging informatics. This allows progression from Radiographer into CT/MRI specialization, senior modality roles, imaging supervision, clinical applications, imaging informatics, research, and AI-enabled medical imaging."}]}]}